#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:112
msgid "Clarifier inlet channel velocity constraints"
msgstr "Restricciones de velocidad del canal de entrada del clarificador"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:112
msgid ""
"The ratio of port velocity to manifold velocity must increase to obtain more"
" uniform flow from the ports."
msgstr ""
"La relación entre la velocidad del puerto y la velocidad del colector debe "
"aumentar para obtener un flujo más uniforme desde los puertos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:114
msgid ""
"The channel velocity must be less than 0.45 m/s to obtain a flow "
"distribution uniformity above 0.9 given that the clarifier head loss is 5 "
"cm."
msgstr ""
"La velocidad del canal debe ser inferior a 0,45 m/s para obtener una "
"uniformidad de distribución del flujo superior a 0,9, dado que el pérdida de"
" carga clarificador es de 5 cm."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:118
msgid "Flocculated Water Dump Channel"
msgstr "Canal de vertido de agua floculada"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:120
msgid ""
"The flocculated water dump channel is activated by the operators when "
"flocculation fails for any reason. The ability to dump water that wasn't "
"properly flocculated enables the AguaClara water treatment plant to recover "
"quickly from a treatment failure because the clarifiers aren't contaminated "
"with poorly flocculated water. Instead the operator can adjust the coagulant"
" dose to recover flocculation and then return the clarifiers to service "
"after a little more than one hydraulic residence time of the flocculator."
msgstr ""
"El canal de vertido de agua floculada es activado por los operadores cuando "
"la floculación falla por cualquier motivo. La capacidad de vaciar agua que "
"no fue correctamente floculada permite que la planta de tratamiento de agua "
"AguaClara se recupere rápidamente de un fallo en el tratamiento porque los "
"clarificadores no están contaminados con agua mal floculada. En su lugar, el"
" operador puede ajustar el dosis de coagulante para recuperar la floculación"
" y luego devolver los clarificadores a servicio tras un poco más de un "
"tiempo hidráulico de residencia del floculador."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:122
msgid ""
"The flocculated water dump channel maintains the water level in the "
"flocculator and clarifiers while the water is temporarily dumped. The "
"channel must be designed to handle the entire flow of the plant."
msgstr ""
"El canal de vertido de agua floculada mantiene la nivel del agua en el "
"floculador y los clarificadores mientras el agua se vierte temporalmente. El"
" canal debe estar diseñado para soportar todo el caudal de la planta."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:124
msgid "add open channel flow equations in the fluids and hydraulics chapter."
msgstr ""
"Añade ecuaciones de flujo de canal abierto en el capítulo de fluidos e "
"hidráulica."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:129
msgid "Inlet Manifold"
msgstr "Colector de entrada"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:131
msgid ""
"Now, we will focus on a single clarifier bay. Flocculated water enters a "
"pipe in the bottom of the inlet channel and travels down a few feet. The "
"pipe then has a 90 degree bend and extends along the bottom of the entire "
"length of the clarifier bay. This section of pipe that distributes water at "
"the bottom of the clarifier bay is referred to as the inlet manifold shown "
"in :numref:`figure_ClarifierInletOutletHydraulics`."
msgstr ""
"Ahora, nos centraremos en una sola bahía clarificadora. El agua floculada "
"entra en una tubería en el fondo del canal de entrada y baja unos pocos "
"pies. La tubería tiene una curva de 90 grados y se extiende a lo largo de "
"toda la longitud de la bahía del clarificador. Esta sección de tubería que "
"distribuye el agua en el fondo de la bahía clarificadora se denomina la "
"manifold de entrada mostrada en "
":numref:`figure_ClarifierInletOutletHydraulics`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:140
msgid "Clarifier Inlet Outlet Hydraulics"
msgstr "Hidráulica de salida de entrada del clarificador"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:140
msgid ""
"Flocculated water flows from the inlet channel to the inlet manifold and "
"then through the diffusers, jet reverser, floc filter, and plate settlers. "
"Clarified water flows into the outlet manifold, the collector channel, "
"across the outlet weir, and into the outlet channel."
msgstr ""
"El agua floculada fluye desde el canal de entrada hacia el manifold de "
"entrada y luego a través de los difusores, el inversor de chorro, el filtro "
"de flóculos y los sedimentadores de placas. agua clarificada fluye hacia el "
"colector de salida, el canal del colector, a través del azud de salida y "
"hacia el canal de salida."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:142
msgid ""
"Clarifier design is strongly influenced by the goal of not breaking flocs "
"down to a size that can't be captured by the plate settlers. The maximum "
"combination of velocity gradient, viscosity, and capture velocity is given "
"by Equation :eq:`G_of_vc_and_floc_props`. Our goal is to eventually provide "
"clear guidance on setting :math:`G_{max}`. In the meantime, given a maximum "
"velocity gradient for the inlet to the clarifier, Equation "
":eq:`planejet_v_max_of_q` provides the maximum jet reverser velocity."
msgstr ""
"El diseño del clarificador está fuertemente influenciado por el objetivo de "
"no descomponer los flócs a un tamaño que no pueda ser capturado por los "
"asentadores de placas. La combinación máxima de gradiente de velocidad, "
"viscosidad y velocidad de captura está dada por la Ecuación "
":eq:`G_of_vc_and_floc_props`. Nuestro objetivo es, en última instancia, "
"proporcionar una guía clara sobre la configuración de :math:`G_{max}`. "
"Mientras tanto, dado un gradiente máximo de velocidad para la entrada del "
"clarificador, la Ecuación :eq:`planejet_v_max_of_q` proporciona la velocidad"
" máxima del inversor del chorro."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:144
msgid ""
"The ratio of manifold velocity to port velocity can be obtained as the "
"inverse of Equation :eq:`Manifold_max_v_no_hl_series`."
msgstr ""
"La razón entre la velocidad de la variedad y la velocidad del puerto puede "
"obtenerse como inversa de la ecuación :eq:`Manifold_max_v_no_hl_series`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:146
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\bar v_{M_1}}{\\bar v_{P}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2(1 - "
"\\Pi_{Q}^2)}{\\Pi_{Q}^2 + 1}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:151
msgid ""
"where the port velocity, :math:`\\bar v_{P}`, is equal to the jet velocity, "
":math:`v_{Jet_{max}}`, from Equation :eq:`planejet_v_max_of_q`. Given a flow"
" uniformity goal, :math:`\\Pi_Q`, of 0.85 the manifold velocity must be less"
" than 0.57 of the jet velocity. This constraint ends up being rather severe."
" Given a maximum velocity gradient of 100 Hz, the maximum jet velocity for a"
" 1 m wide floc filter operating at 5°C and 1 mm/s upflow velocity is 170 "
"mm/s. Equation :eq:`max_clarifier_manifold_velocity` sets the maximum "
"manifold velocity at 97 mm/s. This low velocity results in large diameter "
"manifold pipes and can significantly increase the cost of the unit process."
msgstr ""
"donde la velocidad del puerto, :math:`\\bar v_{P}`, es igual a la velocidad "
"del chorro, :math:`v_{Jet_{max}}`, según la ecuación "
":eq:`planejet_v_max_of_q`. Dado un objetivo de uniformidad del flujo, "
":math:`\\Pi_Q`, de 0,85, la velocidad del colector debe ser menor que 0,57 "
"de la velocidad del chorro. Esta restricción resulta ser bastante severa. "
"Dado un gradiente máximo de velocidad de 100 Hz, la velocidad máxima del "
"chorro para un filtro de flóculos de 1 m de ancho que opera a 5°C y una "
"velocidad de flujo ascendente de 1 mm/s es de 170 mm/s. La ecuación "
":eq:`max_clarifier_manifold_velocity` establece la velocidad máxima del "
"colector en 97 mm/s. Esta baja velocidad da lugar a tuberías de gran "
"diámetro y puede aumentar significativamente el coste del proceso unitario."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:160
msgid "Influent manifold and diffuser flow paths."
msgstr "Trayectorias influyentes de flujo de varietas y difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:162
msgid ""
"The big unknown is the required design value for :math:`\\xi_{breakup}` as "
"defined in Equation :eq:`G_of_vc_and_floc_props`. The expectation is that "
"raw waters with high concentrations of organic matter will have lower "
"density core particles and thus will require a smaller "
":math:`\\xi_{breakup}` for successful capture of the lower density flocs."
msgstr ""
"La gran incógnita es el valor de diseño requerido para "
":math:`\\xi_{breakup}` tal como se define en la Ecuación "
":eq:`G_of_vc_and_floc_props`. Se espera que las aguas crudas con altas "
"concentraciones de materia orgánica tengan partículas núcleo de menor "
"densidad y, por tanto, necesiten un :math:`\\xi_{breakup}` menor para "
"capturar con éxito los flóclos de menor densidad."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:164
msgid ""
"The maximum velocity that could be carried by the inlet manifold given the "
"flow expansion corresponding to the inlet can be calculated using Equation "
":eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max`. This constraint would allow the use of "
"a smaller diameter inlet manifold than the velocity constraint required by "
"Equation :eq:`max_clarifier_manifold_velocity`."
msgstr ""
"La velocidad máxima que podría soportar el manifold de entrada dada la "
"expansión del flujo correspondiente a la entrada puede calcularse usando la "
"Ecuación :eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max`. Esta restricción permitiría "
"usar un diámetro menor manifold de entrada que la restricción de velocidad "
"requerida por la Ecuación :eq:`max_clarifier_manifold_velocity`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:166
msgid ""
"The result of the requirement for a low velocity jet to prevent floc break "
"up is that the inlet manifold has to be large in diameter to obtain "
"reasonably uniform flow distribution between the diffusers. This constraint "
"is fairly severe and results in large diameter (and hence expensive) inlet "
"manifold pipes."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de la necesidad de un chorro de baja velocidad para evitar la "
"ruptura de flócs es que el manifold de entrada debe tener un diámetro grande"
" para obtener una distribución del flujo razonablemente uniforme entre los "
"difusores. Esta restricción es bastante severa y resulta en tuberías de "
"manifold de entrada de gran diámetro (y, por tanto, costosas)."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:168
msgid ""
"The fundamental problem of the inlet manifold is that the diffusers exit "
"perpendicular to the flow of the water in the inlet manifold and thus the "
"flow into the diffusers is set by the difference in piezometric head between"
" the manifold and the floc filter. The kinetic energy at the inlet of the "
"manifold is converted to increased pressure at the end of the manifold. That"
" results in more flow out of the last diffuser ports."
msgstr ""
"El problema fundamental del manifold de entrada es que los difusores salen "
"perpendiculares al flujo del agua en el manifold de entrada y por tanto el "
"flujo hacia los difusores está determinado por la diferencia de altura "
"piezométrica entre el colector y el filtro de flóculos. La energía cinética "
"en la entrada del colector se convierte en un aumento de presión al final "
"del varietor. Esto resulta en un mayor flujo por los últimos puertos del "
"difusor."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:170
msgid ""
"An alternative design would be to have each of the diffuser pipes end inside"
" the manifold with an elbow so that the inlet to the diffuser would face "
"upstream. This change would potentially improve the flow distribution "
"between diffuser pipes, but the large number of diffuser pipes makes this "
"impossible to fabricate without introducing significant additional head loss"
" in the manifold pipe from drag around all of the diffuser inlets."
msgstr ""
"Un diseño alternativo sería que cada uno de los tubos difusores terminara "
"dentro del colector con un codo para que la entrada del difusor estuviera "
"orientada hacia arriba. Este cambio podría mejorar la distribución del flujo"
" entre los tubos difusores, pero el gran número de tubos difusores hace "
"imposible fabricarlo sin introducir pérdida de carga significativamente "
"adicional en el tubo del colector debido al arrastre alrededor de todas las "
"entradas del difusor."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:172
msgid ""
"To overcome the impossibility of having higher velocity in the inlet "
"manifold and directly connecting that to the diffusers we propose to use a "
"two stage manifold system. The manifold pipe will be split into two chambers"
" with the top chamber being the inlet manifold and the bottom section being "
"a new equalization chamber (see :numref:`figure_2stageInletManifold`)."
msgstr ""
"Para superar la imposibilidad de tener mayor velocidad en el manifold de "
"entrada y conectarla directamente a los difusores, proponemos usar un "
"sistema de colectores de dos etapas. El tubo del colector se dividirá en dos"
" cámaras, siendo la cámara superior la manifold de entrada y la inferior una"
" nueva cámara de igualación (véase :numref:`figure_2stageInletManifold`)."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:182
msgid "two stage inlet manifold"
msgstr " manifold de entrada de dos etapas"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:182
msgid ""
"The two stage inlet manifold with upper chamber acting as the inlet manifold"
" and the lower chamber acting to equalize the flow from the diffusers (not "
"shown)."
msgstr ""
"Las dos etapas manifold de entrada con la cámara superior actuando como "
"manifold de entrada y la cámara inferior igualando el flujo de los difusores"
" (no mostrado)."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:184
msgid ""
"The inlet manifold flow is transferred to the equalization chamber through "
"half-pipe ports that are tapered (see "
":numref:`figure_2stageInletManifoldfromUpstream`) to guide flow into the "
"equalization chamber. The taper is designed to be less than the rate of the "
"flow expansion as given by Equation :eq:`PlaneJet_expansion`."
msgstr ""
"El flujo manifold de entrada se transfiere a la cámara de ecualización a "
"través de puertos de medio tubo que son cónicos (véase "
":numref:`figure_2stageInletManifoldfromUpstream`) para guiar el flujo hacia "
"la cámara de ecualización. El cónico está diseñado para ser menor que la "
"tasa de expansión del flujo según la ecuación :eq:`PlaneJet_expansion`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:193
msgid "two stage inlet manifold from upstream"
msgstr "Dos manifold de entrada de etapas desde aguas arriba"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:193
msgid ""
"The half-pipe ports face upstream and slope at a rate that is slower than "
"the rate at which the flow expands to ensure that the flow is fully expanded"
" before the entrance into the next half-pipe port."
msgstr ""
"Los puertos de medio tubo miran aguas arriba y se inclinan a una velocidad "
"menor que la de expansión del caudal para asegurar que el flujo se expanda "
"completamente antes de la entrada al siguiente puerto de medio tubería."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:195
msgid ""
"The manifold system must be designed so that the velocity gradient in all "
"flow expansions is less than the maximum allowed velocity gradient."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de variedades debe diseñarse de modo que el gradiente de "
"velocidad en todas las expansiones de flujo sea menor que el gradiente "
"máximo permitido."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:198
msgid "Manifold diameter"
msgstr "Diámetro de la variedad"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:200
msgid ""
"The manifold diameter must be large enough so that the maximum velocity "
"gradient after the flow transition with the highest minor loss coefficient "
"doesn't exceed the design value of :math:`G_{max}` as given by Equation "
":eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max`. The largest minor loss coefficient is "
"from the 90° elbow that is embedded in the concrete in the floc hopper."
msgstr ""
"El diámetro del colector debe ser lo suficientemente grande para que el "
"gradiente máximo de velocidad tras la transición de flujo con el mayor "
"coeficiente de pérdida menor no supere el valor de diseño de :math:`G_{max}`"
" según la ecuación :eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max`. El mayor coeficiente"
" de pérdida menor proviene del codo de 90° que está incrustado en el "
"hormigón en el tolva de lodos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:202
msgid ""
"The next available nominal diameter pipe that exceeds the inner diameter "
"given by :eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max` is the smallest pipe that can "
"be used. The maximum allowable velocity in the inlet manifold is not a "
"useful constraint because it increases with flow rate. Equation "
":eq:`roundjet_D_min` shows that the maximum allowable velocity increases "
"slowly as the jet diameter increases."
msgstr ""
"La siguiente tubería de diámetro nominal disponible que supera el diámetro "
"interior dado por :eq:`D_pipe_min_of_K_and_jet_G_max` es la tubería más "
"pequeña que se puede utilizar. La velocidad máxima permitida en la manifold "
"de entrada no es una restricción útil porque aumenta con caudal. La ecuación"
" :eq:`roundjet_D_min` muestra que la velocidad máxima permitida aumenta "
"lentamente a medida que aumenta el diámetro del chorro."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:205
msgid "Flow Equalizer"
msgstr "Ecualizador de flujo"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:207
msgid ""
"The flow equalizer dissipates most of the kinetic energy in the inlet "
"manifold as the flow exits the ports and enters the equalizer chamber. The "
"ports face upstream and thus act like pitot tubes with the flow into the "
"port controlled by the difference in total energy head between the manifold "
"and the equalizer rather than controlled by the piezometric head (no kinetic"
" energy term). The ports are sloped at a very gradual angle to allow the "
"flow in the manifold to fully expand before arriving at the next port."
msgstr ""
"El ecualizador de flujo disipa la mayor parte de la energía cinética en el "
"manifold de entrada cuando el flujo sale de los puertos y entra en la cámara"
" del ecualizador. Los puertos miran aguas arriba y, por tanto, actúan como "
"tubos de Pitot, con el flujo hacia el puerto controlado por la diferencia de"
" altura de energía total entre el colector y el ecualizador, en lugar de "
"estar controlado por la cabeza piezométrica (sin término de energía "
"cinética). Los puertos están inclinados en un ángulo muy gradual para "
"permitir que el flujo en el colector se expanda completamente antes de "
"llegar al siguiente puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:209
msgid "The port diameter and port velocity are governed by two constraints."
msgstr ""
"El diámetro del puerto y la velocidad del puerto están gobernados por dos "
"restricciones."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:211
msgid ""
"The slope of the port must be less than the rate of flow expansion in the "
"manifold."
msgstr ""
"La pendiente del puerto debe ser menor que la tasa de expansión del flujo en"
" el colector."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:212
msgid ""
"The velocity gradient created by the jet entering the equalizer must be less"
" than the maximum allowed velocity gradient."
msgstr ""
"El gradiente de velocidad creado por el chorro que entra en el ecualizador "
"debe ser menor que el gradiente máximo permitido."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:214
msgid ""
"For the first constraint we use continuity to ensure that enough water "
"enters the port to serve the diffusers that are in the length of the "
"manifold corresponding to the sloped port. The flow per unit length of the "
"clarifier is"
msgstr ""
"Para la primera restricción usamos continuidad para asegurar que entre "
"suficiente agua en el puerto para servir a los difusores que están en la "
"longitud del colector correspondiente al puerto inclinado. El flujo por "
"unidad de longitud del clarificador es"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:216
msgid ""
"Q_{port} = \\bar v_{port} \\Pi_{vc} \\frac{\\pi D_{port}^2}{8}\n"
"        = \\frac{Q_{manifold}}{L_{jetreverser}} \\Pi_r^L \\frac{D_{port}}{2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:222
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Pi_r^L` is the ratio of the port length to the port radius "
"and must have a value greater than the inverse of the plane jet expansion "
"ratio given in Equation :eq:`PlaneJet_expansion`. Solve for the minimum port"
" diameter."
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`\\Pi_r^L` es la razón entre la longitud del puerto y el radio "
"del puerto y debe tener un valor mayor que el inverso de la razón de "
"expansión del chorro plano dada en la Ecuación :eq:`PlaneJet_expansion`. "
"Resuelve el diámetro mínimo del puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:224
msgid ""
" D_{port_{min}} = \\frac{4 \\Pi_r^L Q_{manifold}}{\\bar v_{port} \\Pi_{vc} "
"L_{jetreverser}\\pi}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:229
msgid ""
"The unknown in Equation :eq:`D_port_min_continuity` is the maximum allowable"
" value for the port velocity, :math:`\\bar v_{port}`. The port velocity is "
"limited by the maximum allowable velocity gradient."
msgstr ""
"La incógnita en la Ecuación :eq:`D_port_min_continuity` es el valor máximo "
"permitido para la velocidad del puerto, :math:`\\bar v_{port}`. La velocidad"
" del puerto está limitada por el gradiente máximo permitido de la velocidad."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:231
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The ports all deliver kinetic energy into the equalizer and that energy has "
"to be dissipated through turbulence without creating any large mean flows. "
"Given that the ports are all pointed in the same direction a high velocity "
"would be generated in the same direction as the velocity in the manifold. To"
" counteract this effect half of the flow from each port must be reversed. "
"This will be accomplished with a jet reverser that will catch approximately "
"50% of the port flow and redirect it upstream. The thickness of this "
"reversed jet will be approximately equal 50% of the port area divided by the"
" port diameter."
msgstr ""
"Todos los puertos suministran energía cinética al ecualizador y esa energía "
"debe disiparse mediante turbulencias sin crear grandes flujos medios. Dado "
"que todos los puertos están orientados en la misma dirección, se generaría "
"una alta velocidad en la misma dirección que la velocidad en el colector. "
"Para contrarrestar este efecto, la mitad del flujo de cada puerto debe "
"invertirse. Esto se logrará con un inversor de chorro que captará "
"aproximadamente el 50% del flujo del puerto y lo redirigirá aguas arriba. El"
" grosor de este chorro invertido será aproximadamente igual al 50% del área "
"del puerto dividido por el diámetro del puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:233
msgid "S_{jet} =  \\frac{\\pi D_{port}}{16}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:238
msgid ""
"The plane jet velocity gradient given in Equation :eq:`planejet_V_max` can "
"be combined with Equation :eq:`S_port_reversed_jet` to obtain the maximum "
"jet velocity."
msgstr ""
"El gradiente de velocidad del chorro plano dado en la Ecuación "
":eq:`planejet_V_max` puede combinarse con la Ecuación "
":eq:`S_port_reversed_jet` para obtener la velocidad máxima del chorro."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:240
msgid ""
"\\bar v_{Port_{max}} = G_{max}^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\left(\\frac{\\nu \\pi "
"D_{port}}{16 \\Pi_{JetPlane} }\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:245
msgid ""
"Now we can combine Equations :eq:`D_port_min_continuity` and "
":eq:`v_port_max_of_G` and solve for the minimum port diameter."
msgstr ""
"Ahora podemos combinar las ecuaciones :eq:`D_port_min_continuity` y "
":eq:`v_port_max_of_G` y resolver el diámetro mínimo del puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:247
msgid ""
" D_{port_{min}} = \\left[\\left(\\frac{16 \\Pi_{JetPlane} }{\\nu \\pi  "
"G_{max}^2 }\\right) \\left(\\frac{4 \\Pi_r^L Q_{manifold}}{ \\Pi_{vc} "
"L_{jetreverser}\\pi} \\right)^3 \\right]^{\\frac{1}{4}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:252
msgid ""
"The port diameter will be rounded up to the next available pipe diameter. "
"The maximum length of the port is given by the maximum flow from the port. "
"The maximum port velocity is given by Equation :eq:`v_port_max_of_G`. The "
"maximum port flow is obtained by multiplying by the port area."
msgstr ""
"El diámetro del puerto se redondeará al siguiente diámetro disponible de la "
"tubería. La longitud máxima del puerto está dada por el caudal máximo desde "
"el puerto. La velocidad máxima del puerto se da por la ecuación "
":eq:`v_port_max_of_G`. El caudal máximo del puerto se obtiene multiplicando "
"por el área del puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:254
msgid ""
"Q_{port_{max}} = \\bar v_{Port_{max}} \\frac{\\pi D_{port}^2}{8} = "
"G_{max}^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\left(\\frac{\\nu \\pi D_{port}}{16 \\Pi_{JetPlane} "
"}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\frac{\\pi D_{port}^2}{8}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:259
msgid ""
"The port center to center distance is obtained by matching the port flow to "
"the flow through the diffusers."
msgstr ""
"La distancia entre el centro del puerto y el centro se obtiene adaptando el "
"flujo del puerto al flujo a través de los difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:261
msgid "Q_{port_{max}} = \\frac{Q_{manifold}}{L_{jetreverser}} B_{port_{max}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:266
msgid ""
"where :math:`B_{port}` is the center to center spacing of the ports. "
"Combining Equations :eq:`port_max_spacing` and "
":eq:`continuity_for_port_spacing` we obtain the maximum port spacing."
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`B_{port}` es el espaciado centro a centro de los puertos. "
"Combinando ecuaciones :eq:`port_max_spacing` y "
":eq:`continuity_for_port_spacing` obtenemos el espaciado máximo entre "
"puertos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:268
msgid ""
"G_{max}^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\left(\\frac{\\nu \\pi D_{port}}{16 \\Pi_{JetPlane} "
"}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\frac{\\pi D_{port}^2}{8} = "
"\\frac{Q_{manifold}}{L_{jetreverser}} B_{port_{max}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:273
msgid "Solve for the port spacing."
msgstr "Resuelve el espaciado de puertos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:275
msgid ""
"B_{port_{max}} = \\frac{L_{jetreverser}}{Q_{manifold}}  \\left(\\frac{\\nu "
"G_{max}^2 \\pi D_{port}}{16 \\Pi_{JetPlane} "
"}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\frac{\\pi D_{port}^2}{8}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:280
msgid ""
"Round down to the port spacing that works given the total length of the jet "
"reverser and the requirement that there be an integer number of ports."
msgstr ""
"Redondea hacia abajo al espaciado de puertos que funciona dado la longitud "
"total del inversor del chorro y el requisito de que haya un número entero de"
" puertos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:282
msgid ""
"The port reverser must have a diameter that is at least double that given by"
" Equation :eq:`S_port_reversed_jet`. The optimal location for installing the"
" port reverser is not yet determined. The port reverser is installed with "
"its center below dividing plate. The port reverser center coincides with the"
" center of the port. The assumption is that the flow has not expanded "
"significantly and thus the port reverser will catch the flow in the upper "
"half of the port reverser."
msgstr ""
"El inversor de puerto debe tener un diámetro al menos el doble que el "
"indicado por la Ecuación :eq:`S_port_reversed_jet`. La ubicación óptima para"
" instalar el inversor de puertos aún no está determinada. El inversor de "
"puertos se instala con su centro debajo de la placa divisoria. El centro del"
" inversor de puerto coincide con el centro del puerto. Se asume que el flujo"
" no se ha expandido significativamente y, por tanto, el inversor de puerto "
"captará el flujo en la mitad superior del inversor de puerto."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:285
msgid "Jet Reverser"
msgstr "Inversor de chorro"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:287
msgid ""
"The diffuser delivers water to the jet reverser. We cover these two elements"
" in reverse order because the jet reverser provides the design constraint "
"for the diffusers."
msgstr ""
"El difusor suministra agua al inversor de chorro. Cubrimos estos dos "
"elementos en orden inverso porque el inversor de chorro proporciona la "
"restricción de diseño para los difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:289
msgid ""
"Although the diffusers don't create a continuous line jet, the flow will "
"quickly tend to spread to uniform thickness as it flows through the jet "
"reverser. The velocity exiting the diffusers and the velocity exiting the "
"jet reverser is almost identical because momentum is conserved and there is "
"no significant flow expansion as the flow is reversed. The thickness of the "
"jet exiting the reverser is constrained to not create velocity gradients "
"greater than the :math:`G_{max}` used for the design of the flow passages "
"from the flocculator to the floc filter as derived in Equation "
":eq:`planejet_S_of_q`."
msgstr ""
"Aunque los difusores no crean un chorro de línea continua, el flujo tenderá "
"rápidamente a extenderse a un espesor uniforme mientras fluye a través del "
"inversor del chorro. La velocidad que sale de los difusores y la velocidad "
"que sale del inversor del chorro es casi idéntica porque el momento se "
"conserva y no hay una expansión significativa del flujo al invertirse el "
"flujo. El grosor del chorro que sale del inversor está restringido para no "
"crear gradientes de velocidad mayores que los :math:`G_{max}` usados para el"
" diseño de los pasajes de flujo desde el floculador hasta el filtro de "
"flóculos como se deduce en la Ecuación :eq:`planejet_S_of_q`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:291
msgid ""
"Given the assumption of conservation of velocity as the jet issuing from the"
" diffuser travels around the jet reverser it can be deduced that the flow "
"area is also conserved."
msgstr ""
"Dada la suposición de conservación de la velocidad mientras el chorro que "
"sale del difusor rodea el inversor del chorro, se puede deducir que el área "
"de flujo también se conserva."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:293
msgid "W_D S_D = S_{Jet} B_D"
msgstr "W_D S_D = S_{Jet} B_D"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:298
msgid ""
"where :math:`W_D`, :math:`S_D`, and :math:`B_D` are defined in "
":numref:`figure_diffuser_dimensions` and :math:`S_{Jet}` is the thickness of"
" the jet leaving the jet reverser as defined by Equation "
":eq:`planejet_S_of_q`. Note that the S dimensions for the jet and for the "
"diffuser are in different directions."
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`W_D`, :math:`S_D`, y :math:`B_D` se definen en "
":numref:`figure_diffuser_dimensions` y :math:`S_{Jet}` es el grosor del "
"chorro que sale del inversor del chorro según lo definido por la ecuación "
":eq:`planejet_S_of_q`. Nótese que las dimensiones S para el chorro y para el"
" difusor están en direcciones diferentes."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:301
msgid "Diffuser"
msgstr "Difusor"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:303
msgid ""
"The diffuser delivers water from the flow equalizer to the jet reverser. The"
" critical dimensions are defined in :numref:`figure_diffuser_dimensions`"
msgstr ""
"El difusor suministra agua desde el ecualizador de flujo al inversor de "
"chorro. Las dimensiones críticas se definen en "
":numref:`figure_diffuser_dimensions`"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:312
msgid "Diffuser dimension definition"
msgstr "Definición de dimensión del difusor"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:312
msgid "Dimensions of the diffusers."
msgstr "Dimensiones de los difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:314
msgid ""
"The perimeter dimension of the rectangularly formed part of the diffuser is "
"increased slightly due to stretching."
msgstr ""
"La dimensión perimetral de la parte rectangular del difusor se incrementa "
"ligeramente debido al estiramiento."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:316
msgid "2\\left(W_D + S_D\\right) = \\pi {\\rm ID}_D \\Pi_{stretch}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:321
msgid ""
"where :math:`{\\rm ID}_D` is the inner diameter of the diffuser pipe and "
":math:`\\Pi_{stretch}` is the factor describing the perimeter that can be "
"created by heating and molding the PVC pipe. The value of "
":math:`\\Pi_{stretch}` is approximately 1.1."
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`{\\rm ID}_D` es el diámetro interior del tubo difusor y "
":math:`\\Pi_{stretch}` es el factor que describe el perímetro que se puede "
"crear calentando y moldeando el tubo de PVC. El valor de "
":math:`\\Pi_{stretch}` es aproximadamente 1,1."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:323
msgid ""
"The center to center spacing of the diffusers, :math:`B_D`, must be large "
"enough to not cause interference between diffusers and the gap between "
"diffusers must be small enough that the diffuser jets combine into a "
"continuous line jet as they flow around the jet reverser. We don't have a "
"good estimate for how much the diffuser jets expand and hence how large of a"
" gap is permissible between diffusers."
msgstr ""
"El espacio entre el centro y el centro de los difusores, :math:`B_D`, debe "
"ser lo suficientemente grande para no causar interferencias entre difusores "
"y el espacio entre difusores debe ser lo bastante pequeño para que los "
"chorros del difusor se combinen en un chorro de línea continua mientras "
"fluyen alrededor del inversor del chorro. No tenemos una buena estimación de"
" cuánto se expanden los chorros del difusor y, por tanto, de cuánto espacio "
"es permitido entre difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:325
msgid ""
"The current design approach is to set the spacing based on the simplifying "
"assumption that no plastic is needed for the short diffuser walls. This is "
"equivalent to assuming that the slot width is zero."
msgstr ""
"El enfoque actual de diseño consiste en fijar el espaciamiento basándose en "
"la suposición simplificadora de que no se necesita plástico para las paredes"
" cortas del difusor. Esto equivale a asumir que el ancho de ranura es cero."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:327
msgid ""
"B_D = ceil\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\left({\\rm OD}_D^2 - {\\rm ID}_D^2 "
"\\right) \\frac{\\Pi_{stretch}}{{\\rm OD}_D - {\\rm ID}_D}\\right]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:333
msgid ""
"We now have two Equations, :eq:`diffuser_area` and :eq:`diffuser_perimeter`,"
" and two unknowns, :math:`W_D` and :math:`S_D`. Eliminating :math:`S_D` in "
"Equation :eq:`diffuser_perimeter` we obtain"
msgstr ""
"Ahora tenemos dos ecuaciones, :eq:`diffuser_area` y "
":eq:`diffuser_perimeter`, y dos incógnitas, :math:`W_D` y :math:`S_D`. "
"Eliminando :math:`S_D` en la ecuación :eq:`diffuser_perimeter` obtenemos"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Design.rst:335
msgid ""
"2\\left(W_D + \\frac{S_{Jet} B_D}{W_D}\\right) = \\pi {\\rm ID}_D "
"\\Pi_{stretch}"
